# --- this fork ------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Zig build graph here writes nothing into the source tree. The generated
# pcre2.h, the copied pcre2_chartables.c and the generated config.h are build
# outputs of `b.addWriteFiles` and `b.addConfigHeader`, so they land under the
# build cache directory; the artifacts land in the install prefix. The four Zig
# rules above carry no leading slash, so they match at any depth and already
# cover the nested consumer package in consumer/ and its own cache and prefix.
#
# Nothing this fork adds to the tree is excluded by any rule above, and none of
# the rules above is removed or narrowed here: they belong to upstream's
# autotools, CMake and Bazel builds, which are still how a source checkout of
# this repository is configured, and this fork replaces none of them.
#
# The negations below name the fork's own sources for that reason only. They are
# a no-op today; they exist because this file is upstream's, is shared with every
# other PCRE2 checkout, and the normal way a file goes missing from a package is
# an upstream rule broadening to cover it. A negation cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is excluded, so each directory is named as well as its
# contents.
!translate.h
!cross-test.profile.sh
!/zig/
!/tests.zig
!/smoke.zig
!/consumer/
!/testdata/

# End
